# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository and on checkout, matching
# prettier's endOfLine: lf. Without this, core.autocrlf=true on Windows checks
# files out as CRLF while Linux CI checks them out as LF, so prettier passed
# locally but failed in CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets git must never try to normalize.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
